"""OpenAI Agents SDK agent for {{name}}.

Managed by Armature: change armature.yaml and run `armature generate` rather than
editing this file. Your code lives in tools/ and prompts/.

Run hooks report every model call to the ARC runtime, and each tool's
on_invoke_tool goes through the runtime so limits, stubs and records apply. Tools
that need approval use the SDK's needs_approval: a paused run keeps its RunState
here until the reviewer's decisions arrive.
"""

